  - type: article
    title: "Chapter 2: Plasma confinement and transport (ITER Physics Basis)"
    authors:
      - name: "ITER Physics Expert Groups on Confinement and Transport and Confinement Modelling and Database"
    journal: "Nuclear Fusion"
    volume: 39
    start: 2175
    year: 1999
    notes: "Source of the IPB98(y,2) scaling law used as the physics baseline."
  - type: article
